.TH N64INPUT 1 "June 12, 2026"
.UC 4
.SH NAME
n64input \- inspect Nintendo 64 Joybus input devices
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B n64input list
.br
.B n64input joypad
[
.I port
]
.br
.B n64input mouse
[
.I port
]
.br
.B n64input kbd
[
.I port
]
.br
.B n64input kbd-led
.I port value
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B n64input
is a smoke-test utility for the RetroBSD/N64 Joybus drivers.
.PP
.B list
prints the current Joybus identifier and status for controller ports 0 through
3.
.PP
.B joypad ,
.B mouse ,
and
.B kbd
read the selected per-port device node and print one current snapshot.
The default port is 0.
.PP
.B kbd-led
sets the RandNET keyboard LED byte used by subsequent keyboard polls.
.SH FILES
.TP 12
.I /dev/joypad0
first N64 controller-port joypad device
.TP 12
.I /dev/mouse0
first N64 controller-port mouse device
.TP 12
.I /dev/kbd0
first N64 controller-port RandNET keyboard device
